++-------------------------------------------------------------------+
+|  GHASH(X, H)                                                      |
+|-------------------------------------------------------------------|
+|  Input:                                                           |
+|  - bit string X = X_1 | ... | X_m, X_1, ... , X_m in V_n.         |
+|  Output:                                                          |
