++-------------------------------------------------------------------+
+|  GCM-ACPKM-Master-Encrypt(N, K, T*, ICN, P, A)                    |
+|-------------------------------------------------------------------|
+|  Input:                                                           |
+|  - section size N,                                                |
+|  - initial key K,                                                 |
+|  - master key frequency T*,                                       |
+|  - initial counter nonce ICN in V_{n-c},                          |
+|  - plaintext P = P_1 | ... | P_b, |P| <= m_max.                   |
