+|  1. K^1 = ACPKM-Master(T*, K, k, 1)                               |
+|  2. H = E_{K^1}(0^n)                                              |
+|  3. ICB_0 = ICN | 0^{c-1} | 1                                     |
+|  4. C = GCTR(N, K, T*, Inc_c(ICB_0), P)                           |
+|  5. u = n * ceil(|C| / n) - |C|                                   |
